  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5eca3abc5c99cc8",
      "translationZh": "你这假冒为善的人，先去掉自己眼中的梁木，然后你才能看得清楚，去掉你弟兄眼中的刺。《马太福音》7章3-5节",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "64459b6056cea83e",
      "translationZh": "太长不看版",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb8f432d6782415f",
      "translationZh": "我们为 smolagents 添加了视觉支持，使智能体流水线能够原生使用视觉语言模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a9360e0212a4d173",
      "translationZh": "目录",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d4b1ea5708dd5329",
      "translationZh": "概述",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3d1cd0e6fd5a3f5a",
      "translationZh": "我们如何让 smolagents 拥有视觉",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b179c2ec8ce93645",
      "translationZh": "如何创建具备视觉能力的网页浏览智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "759f4c0213571add",
      "translationZh": "后续步骤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d4b1ea5708dd5329",
      "translationZh": "概览",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24a75fb3ff98e8b5",
      "translationZh": "在智能体的世界里，许多能力都被一道视觉屏障挡住了。一个常见的例子是网页浏览：网页包含丰富的视觉内容，仅仅提取文本永远无法完整还原这些内容，无论是对象的相对位置、通过颜色传递的信息，还是特定的图标……在这种情况下，视觉对智能体而言确实是一种超能力。所以，我们刚刚为 smolagents 加入了这项能力！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "22d6e9d3b72d49f3",
      "translationZh": "先预告一下这会带来什么：一个能够完全自主浏览网页的智能体浏览器！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21273e17ce94b590",
      "translationZh": "下面是一个示例，展示了它的实际效果：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3d1cd0e6fd5a3f5a",
      "translationZh": "我们如何让 smolagents 拥有视觉",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7a9ad2ee8f528a0",
      "translationZh": "🤔 我们想如何将图像传递给智能体？传递图像有两种方式：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ec4ca9f679f58461",
      "translationZh": "可以让智能体在启动时就直接获得图像。文档 AI 通常就是这种情况。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "449098bd05649307",
      "translationZh": "有时，需要动态添加图像。一个很好的例子是，网页浏览器刚刚执行了某个操作，需要查看该操作对其视口的影响。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b5af63b10c642881",
      "translationZh": "1. 在智能体启动时一次性传入图像",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0de1efcc596b7409",
      "translationZh": "对于希望一次性传入图像的情况，我们新增了在 run 方法中向智能体传入图像列表的功能：agent.run(\"Describe these images:\", images=[image_1, image_2])。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "47258c19c967ee3b",
      "translationZh": "随后，这些输入图像会与待完成任务的提示词一起，存储在 TaskStep 的 task_images 属性中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52daaed79e41b1fa",
      "translationZh": "运行智能体时，这些图像会被传递给模型。这在根据包含视觉元素的长篇 PDF 执行操作等场景中非常实用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "00f2215556c8d9c0",
      "translationZh": "2. 在每一步传入图像 ⇒ 使用回调",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8cca24d2c97710cc",
      "translationZh": "如何动态地将图像添加到智能体的记忆中？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7d9a7aea10df7a16",
      "translationZh": "要找到答案，我们首先需要了解智能体的工作方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24309fb136aa1384",
      "translationZh": "smolagents 中的所有智能体都基于同一个 MultiStepAgent 类，该类是对 ReAct 框架的抽象。基本上，这个类会循环执行以下步骤来完成操作，并按如下方式将已有变量和知识纳入智能体日志：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1a03bf065d76c2ef",
      "translationZh": "初始化：系统提示词存储在 SystemPromptStep 中，用户查询记录在 TaskStep 中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25b981f18cecb4d5",
      "translationZh": "ReAct 循环（While）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "536319f311be9d55",
      "translationZh": "使用 agent.write_inner_memory_from_logs() 将智能体日志写入一个由 LLM 可读的聊天消息组成的列表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "40a1a6e61d98caf2",
      "translationZh": "将这些消息发送给 Model 对象，以获取其补全内容。解析补全内容以获取动作（对于 ToolCallingAgent，是一个 JSON 数据块；对于 CodeAgent，是一个代码片段）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0bf6f519dd83607e",
      "translationZh": "执行动作，并将结果记录到记忆中（一个 ActionStep）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dfdc0aaa1c2724fc",
      "translationZh": "在每一步结束时，运行 agent.step_callbacks 中定义的所有回调函数。⇒ 这就是我们添加图像支持的地方：创建一个将图像记录到记忆中的回调函数！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "edaf542578e60395",
      "translationZh": "下图详细展示了这一过程：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63dc91fdfa075dee",
      "translationZh": "如你所见，对于动态检索图像的用例（例如网页浏览器智能体），我们支持将图像添加到模型的 ActionStep 中，存放在 step_log.observation_images 属性中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "67829d0b1c2e129f",
      "translationZh": "这可以通过回调来实现，回调会在每个步骤结束时运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "696bcd4b3b6b1c0e",
      "translationZh": "下面我们来演示如何创建这样的回调，并用它构建一个网页浏览智能体。👇👇",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b179c2ec8ce93645",
      "translationZh": "如何创建具备视觉能力的网页浏览智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb9ef4c8fa741d5d",
      "translationZh": "我们将使用 helium。它提供了基于 selenium 的浏览器自动化功能：这能让我们的智能体更轻松地操作网页。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e65af065ffdcfe4",
      "translationZh": "智能体本身可以直接使用 helium，因此不需要专门的工具：它可以直接使用 helium 执行操作，例如通过 click(\"top 10\") 点击页面上可见的、名为“top 10”的按钮。不过，我们仍然需要制作一些工具来帮助智能体浏览网页：一个用于返回上一页，另一个用于关闭弹出窗口，因为这些弹出窗口的关闭按钮上没有任何文字，helium 很难定位到它们。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f7e4fdbd203051f",
      "translationZh": "目前，智能体还没有视觉输入。因此，我们来演示如何通过回调，在它的步骤日志中动态提供图像。我们创建一个名为 save_screenshot 的回调，它会在每个步骤结束时运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c16c81430399706",
      "translationZh": "这里最重要的一行，是将图像添加到观测图像中的这一行：step_log.observations_images = [image.copy()]。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e953ddad2c592d7",
      "translationZh": "这个回调接受 step_log 和智能体本身作为参数。将 agent 作为输入，就可以执行比仅修改最新日志更深入的操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9dfa27831b677fb2",
      "translationZh": "我们来创建一个模型。我们已为所有模型添加了图像支持。只需说明一点：当 TransformersModel 与 VLM 搭配使用时，为了让它正常工作，你需要在初始化时将 flatten_messages_as_text 设为 False，如下所示：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88a8cc586cbd17cc",
      "translationZh": "在这个演示中，我们通过 Fireworks API 使用一个更大的 Qwen2VL：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ad45277f6441ed2",
      "translationZh": "现在我们继续定义智能体。我们将 verbosity_level 设为最高级别，以显示 LLM 的完整输出消息，从而查看它的思路；同时将 max_steps 增加到 20，让智能体有更多步骤来探索网页。我们还为它提供了上面定义的回调函数 save_screenshot。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c9571156c12b4cb",
      "translationZh": "最后，我们为智能体提供一些关于使用 helium 的指导。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "aa58fe4818049c11",
      "translationZh": "运行智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f2e8f1651f66d44d",
      "translationZh": "现在一切准备就绪：让我们运行智能体吧！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63eb4257d249c990",
      "translationZh": "不过请注意，这项任务确实很难：根据你使用的 VLM，它可能并不总能成功。像 Qwen2VL-72B 或 GPT-4o 这样强大的 VLM，成功率会更高。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "759f4c0213571add",
      "translationZh": "后续步骤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a69203c696c96931",
      "translationZh": "这将让你初步了解具备视觉能力的 CodeAgent 能做些什么，但还有更多值得探索！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ffb2728354d1f1d4",
      "translationZh": "你可以在这里开始使用智能体式网页浏览器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "70099a173158db54",
      "translationZh": "阅读我们的发布博客文章，进一步了解 smolagents。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "157379ba225479ac",
      "translationZh": "阅读 smolagents 文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80142ff588cd079c",
      "translationZh": "我们期待看到你使用视觉语言模型和 smolagents 构建的成果！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
